{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"ALSA-2026:92157","published":"2026-10-29T00:00:00Z","modified":"2026-10-29T11:02:29.817376357Z","related":["CVE-2026-53939"],"upstream":["CVE-2026-53939"],"summary":"Critical: mod_auth_openidc:2.3 security update","details":"The mod_auth_openidc is an OpenID Connect authentication module for Apache HTTP Server. It enables an Apache HTTP Server to operate as an OpenID Connect Relying Party and/or OAuth 2.0 Resource Server.   \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * cjose: OpenIDC/cjose uses all-zero Content Encryption Key for AES-CBC-HMAC JWE encryption (CVE-2026-53939)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"cjose","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:8","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/cjose"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"0.6.1-6.module_el8.10.0+4330+15616d81"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux8/ALSA-2026:92157.json"}},{"package":{"name":"cjose-devel","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:8","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/cjose-devel"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"0.6.1-6.module_el8.10.0+4330+15616d81"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux8/ALSA-2026:92157.json"}},{"package":{"name":"mod_auth_openidc","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:8","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/mod_auth_openidc"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2.4.9.4-9.module_el8.10.0+4297+63ae3533"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux8/ALSA-2026:92157.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:92157"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-539